## 7. AUTHENTICATION (`src/hooks/useAuth.js`)

- **Provider:** `AuthProvider` wraps the app via `AuthContext`
- **Hook:** `useAuth()` — must be inside `<AuthProvider>`
- **Methods exposed:**
  - `signUp({ email, password, displayName })` — Supabase email/password signup
  - `signIn({ email, password })` — signInWithPassword
  - `signInWithGoogle()` — OAuth redirect
  - `signOut()`
  - `resetPasswordForEmail(email)` — redirects to `/reset-password`
  - `updatePassword(newPassword)`
  - `updateProfile(updates)`
  - `resendVerificationEmail(email)`
- **State:** `user`, `session`, `loading`, `displayName`, `avatarUrl`
- **HR Admin check:** `useHrAdmin()` hook in `src/hooks/useHrAdmin.ts` — calls `supabase.rpc('is_hr_admin')`

