## 13. ACCESS MODEL

| Role | Capabilities |
|---|---|
| **Public visitor** | View public charts (safe data only, no staff profiles) |
| **Authenticated user** | Owns their charts; creates/edits/deletes own charts and folders |
| **Chart viewer (accepted)** | Can view invited charts and masked staff profiles |
| **Chart editor (accepted)** | Can edit chart + assign/transfer/vacate staff positions |
| **HR administrator** | Full staff directory access; manages staff, skills, job architecture, org structure |

- `getChartAccess(chart, user)` in `src/utils/chartAccess.js` returns `{ canView, canEdit, isOwner, acceptedShare }`
- `HrAdminRoute.tsx` wraps admin pages — redirects non-HR users
- `ProtectedRoute` (in App.jsx) redirects unauthenticated users to `/login`

