## 15. DATA BOUNDARIES (SECURITY)

- Chart JSON stores: layout, edges, position display info, stable relational references (`positionId`, `dbStaffId`)
- Chart JSON does NOT store: phone, email, address, National ID, education, skills, assignment history
- Staff profiles loaded on-demand via permission-aware `get_staff_profile` RPC
- Public visitors receive only `PublicChartOccupantSchema` data (name, nameEn, positionTitle)
- `staff_sensitive` table (National ID) is strictly HR-only
- All enforcement is via Supabase RLS policies + RPC authorization — frontend guards are UX-only

